# WS1-05/WS3-03. Source: spec/04-expressions.md §5 EX-5: the minimum signed value
# modulo -1 is the runtime fault E11210 (for i16 the minimum is -32768).
# Contrast: -32768 % 3 truncates toward zero: -2.
expect: fault E11210
contrast: modI16(-32768, -1) ==> modI16(-32768, 3)
contrast-expect: output
--- contrast-output
-2
